Chapter: RvModWide
  cites Foreword chapter Console

Section: Probes

 A modulus by a power of two above 4096 needs a mask wider than the 12-bit
 andi immediate; the first line is the case the riscv plug once answered
 unchanged (4294967301).

  low32 : Integer -> Integer
  low32 (v) = int-mod v 4294967296

  low12 : Integer -> Integer
  low12 (v) = int-mod v 4096

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (low32 4294967301))
    print-line-uni (show (low32 12345))
    print-line-uni (show (low12 8195))
  end
